query q_d_rel_bereken_isolatie_opties is:
    the bereken isolatie opties include which delta r with which extra dikte mm with which materiaal kosten with which installatie kosten with which totale kosten with which subsidie with which netto kosten with which besparing jaar with which terugverdientijd with which aanbeveling.

